    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Goodnight Moon is a celebration of familiar nighttime rituals, while The Runaway Bunny’s pretend tale of leaving home evokes reassuring responses from his loving mum. Both feature endearing rabbit characters, and the soothing…"
