    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;SEVEN DRUNKEN NIGHTS: The Story Of The Dubliners Direct from London’s West End and having sold out venues worldwide, Seven Drunken Nights – The Story of The Dubliners will return to theatres in 2025 for its world tour…and the East Coast of Canada is one of their stops! In partnership with Tourism Ireland and in&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
